<title>FINLAND: Merrill Lynch reaffirms Ericsson &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch reaffirms Ericsson &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said on Wednesday that it had reaffirmed its &quot;buy&quot; recommendation on Swedish telecommunications group LM Ericsson.</p>
<p>Rumours about Merrill Lynch changing its recommendation on Ericsson was driving the share up on Wednesday afternoon with the stock six crowns higher at 292 crowns at 1315 GMT.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch analyst Neil Barton told Reuters that Merrill Lynch had reaffirmed its buy recommendation on Ericsson.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
